格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 本机安全评测与提示词清洗插件：侧栏面板管理提示词分层、补丁、规则集与技能；带授权演练台。Local security-eval & prompt-cleaning plugin for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1428304514","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-purge","slug":"chs-1108/dsh-purge","topics":["agent","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm-security","prompt-engineering","red-team"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 本机安全评测与提示词清洗插件：侧栏面板管理提示词分层、补丁、规则集与技能；带授权演练台。Local security-eval & prompt-cleaning p"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"lugin for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-purge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness local security-eval & prompt-cleaning plugin"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Version 1.2.3"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"= 18\">"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **What it is, in one line:** a local plugin for the DeepSeek Harness you already run. It gives you"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" a side dock to see and adjust the harness's own prompt layers, approval policy, and tool limits — p"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"lus a prompt/rule-set manager and a separate drill console for authorized red-team work on hosts you"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"mpt/rule-set manager and a separate drill console for authorized red-team work on hosts you control."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> **Not a model wrapper.** Harness rewrites prompts, gates approvals, and enforces sandbox policy at"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" runtime. \"The model refused\" and \"the host blocked it\" look identical from the outside. This plugin"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" separates those two layers on your own install, so you can tell which one you are looking at."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Features\n- Requirements\n- Install\n- Quick start\n- Screenshots\n- Usage\n- Configuration\n- Runtime fi"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"les\n- How it works\n- Restore & uninstall\n- Troubleshooting\n- Project structure\n- Development\n- Attri"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"bution\n- Disclaimer\n- License"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Feature | What it does |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **Side dock** | A `dsh-purge` button next to the session title opens a right-hand panel with two p"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ages: **Clean** and **Drill**. Light / Ink themes |\n| **Patch status** | Every host-layer patch is l"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"isted with its real state (`applied` / `pending` / `skipped` / `missing_file`), grouped by area. Cou"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"nts only include what actually applied |\n| **Apply / Restore / Uninstall** | One click each. Apply i"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"s idempotent and backs up originals first; Restore puts the originals back; Uninstall reverts then r"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"emoves the plugin |\n| **Prompt injection** | Edit `prompt-inject.md` in the dock, or keep several ru"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"le sets and switch between them. Injection is re-applied every turn, so a new chat never starts half"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"-clean |\n| **Rule sets** | Multiple `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` profiles under `$DSH_HOME`. Enable wri"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"tes the file, Delete removes the row |\n| **Workspace policy** | `strict` / `fallback` / `always` — d"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"ecides whether the harness's own workspace baseline section survives alongside your prompt |\n| **Own"},{"id":"p13s11","text":" servers** | A whitelist (`$DSH_HOME/net-scope-allow.txt`) of exact IPs / hostnames that are yours. "},{"id":"p13s12","text":"Anything not listed stays out of scope |\n| **Skills** | Import a zip or folder into the host's own `"},{"id":"p13s13","text":"$DSH_HOME/skills/<id>/SKILL.md`. DSH keeps ownership of matching, loading, and `/name` |\n| **Rewind*"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"* | Composer \"Undo once\" / \"Undo last round\" and `/rewind`, built on the official `session.fork({ at"},{"id":"p13s15","text":"Seq })` |\n| **Self-check on start** | After `npm`/`pnpm` rewrites `node_modules`, the plugin notices"},{"id":"p13s16","text":" and re-applies instead of asking you to hand-edit files |\n| **Drill console** | A separate page for"},{"id":"p13s17","text":" assets, skills, and environment checks. Gated behind a notice + countdown + three checkboxes. Only "},{"id":"p13s18","text":"for hosts you manage or offline/authorized targets |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"No hardcoded drive letters. Home resolution order: `$DSH_HOME` → `.dsh` next to the dsh launcher → `"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"oded drive letters. Home resolution order: `$DSH_HOME` → `.dsh` next to the dsh launcher → `~/.dsh`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Item | Requirement |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Host | Official **DeepSeek Harness 0.2.x** — `dsh web` **and** the official desktop EXE (each has "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"its own profile; install and Apply separately) |\n| Node.js | **≥ 18** |\n| OS | Windows, macOS, Linux"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" |\n| Privileges | Write access to `$DSH_HOME` and to the installed `@deepseek-ai/*` packages |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Older hosts (dsh 0.1.x) are not supported by this line — unmatched patches would stay `pending` or `"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"skipped`, nothing is rewritten blindly."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Option 1 — one command (recommended)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install from this repository straight into a profile:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Option 2 — tarball / zip"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Or download the zip from Releases (or **Code → Download ZIP**), then follow **Option 4**."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Option 3 — clone into the plugin directory"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The folder must be named `dsh-purge` and contain a `package.json` whose `\"name\"` is `dsh-purge`. Cop"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"y the whole tree — not a handful of `.js` files."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Option 4 — manual profile edit"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Use this when the command fails or `dsh` is not on PATH. Edit **only the profile of the host you act"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"n the command fails or `dsh` is not on PATH. Edit **only the profile of the host you actually run**."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"1. **Put the plugin at `$DSH_HOME/plugins/dsh-purge`** (see Option 3, or extract the zip and rename "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"`dsh-purge-master` → `dsh-purge`)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"2. **Back up, then edit that profile's `package.json`.** Add exactly two things and keep every exist"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"up, then edit that profile's `package.json`.** Add exactly two things and keep every existing entry:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"`dsh-purge` must appear in **both** `dependencies` and the **end** of `dsh.profile.bundles`. A depen"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"dency without the bundle entry installs the files but never loads the plugin."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"3. **Install dependencies in that profile only:**"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Success looks like `profiles/<web|desktop>/node_modules/dsh-purge/package.json` existing."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### After installing: three steps"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Adding the plugin to a profile does **not** patch the harness by itself."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Apply** (on boot or when you click it):"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**Every turn**, the injection source is decided in this order:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Two invariants the plugin maintains at assembly time:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- **No unregistered prompt variables escape.** The host's renderer throws on any `{{name}}` it did n"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"ot register, which kills the whole request. Every section is passed through a guard that resolves `{"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"{cwd}}` to the real path and degrades anything else to `{ {name}}`.\n- **The injected text leads the "},{"id":"p47s4","text":"assembly.** Later sections cannot outrank it by accident, and duplicate copies are removed by conten"},{"id":"p47s5","text":"t match rather than position."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
